  "steps_required": [
    "Second STAC API root: https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/api/stac/v1 (Earth Search: https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1). The collection ID is the same: sentinel-2-l2a.",
    "Item IDs follow different schemes (Earth Search: platform_tile_date_sequence_level; Planetary Computer: ESA product name without the processing-baseline field). Neither ID can be converted into the other; items were matched on platform, sensing start, relative orbit and MGRS tile parsed from the s2:product_uri property.",
    "The tile is queried with different properties: Earth Search splits it into mgrs:utm_zone, mgrs:latitude_band and mgrs:grid_square; Planetary Computer has s2:mgrs_tile.",
    "Asset keys differ: red -> B04, nir -> B08, scl -> SCL (Earth Search key -> Planetary Computer key).",
    "Planetary Computer assets need a short-lived SAS token from https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/api/sas/v1/token/sentinel-2-l2a appended to every asset URL; an unsigned range request returned HTTP 409. Earth Search assets are public S3 objects read without a token.",
    "Calibration source differs: Earth Search assets publish raster:bands scale 0.0001 and offset -0.1, but the pixels already have the offset removed (earthsearch:boa_offset_applied = True), so offset 0 is used. Planetary Computer assets have no raster:bands entry (raster_bands_in_stac = False); scale and offset were read from MTD_MSIL2A.xml (BOA_QUANTIFICATION_VALUE, BOA_ADD_OFFSET), one extra HTTP request per item.",
    "before: item datetime differs for the same acquisition (Earth Search 2018-08-18T11:30:42.942000Z, Planetary Computer 2018-08-18T11:21:11.024000Z); processing baseline Earth Search 05.00 vs Planetary Computer 02.12; Planetary Computer product has no BOA_ADD_OFFSET (baseline < 04.00), offset 0.",
    "after: item datetime differs for the same acquisition (Earth Search 2025-08-21T11:31:03.493000Z, Planetary Computer 2025-08-21T11:21:31.025000Z); processing baseline Earth Search 05.11 vs Planetary Computer 05.11; Planetary Computer BOA_ADD_OFFSET red/NIR = -1000/-1000 DN, applied.",
    "Platform property spelling differs (Earth Search 'sentinel-2a', Planetary Computer 'Sentinel-2A').",
    "Pixel grids: same CRS and identical 10 m tile transform on both providers, so no resampling was needed."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Reflectance and NDVI are computed in float32, as in run_case_study.py; differences below about 1e-6 are floating-point rounding, not data differences.",
    "SCL masks are taken from each provider's own product; pixels are compared only where both masks are valid (joint_valid_pixels).",
    "share_pc_dn_plus_offset_equals_es_dn = share of jointly valid pixels where PC DN + BOA_ADD_OFFSET equals the Earth Search DN exactly."
